// TEST: perf-expect proven 20
// 128 stored rows read with a symbolic row (#1825): the address of each row is a constant and the
// handle `grid[i]` is one of them, so the read is one case per row and not a search over every
// address. It took 8 s for 64 rows and 43 s for 128 (a loaded machine) and grew cubically; it is now
// decided in well under a second.
module GridRowsWideSymbolicRead

